 $('#help').onclick=()=>showDialog('A clear view of the numbers',`<div class="stats-list"><div><span>Engagement rate</span><strong>(likes + comments + shares + saves) ÷ reach</strong></div><div><span>Viral score</span><strong>100 × (3 shares + 2 saves + likes) ÷ reach</strong></div><div><span>Relatability</span><strong>Relatable labels ÷ analyzed comments</strong></div><div><span>Save-to-share</span><strong>Saves ÷ shares</strong></div><div><span>Retention</span><strong>View-weighted mean of post retention</strong></div></div><p class="note">Aggregate reach is the sum of post reach, not deduplicated people. Attributed follows are gains credited to posts, not net account growth. A zero denominator displays “—”. A viral score is not a reproduction coefficient or validated forecast. Model output is an estimate, not a diagnosis or measured emotional state.</p><a class="btn" href="reports/methodology.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="margin-top:18px">Read the full methodology ↗</a>`);
